@SmartX.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5080

### Root / service info
GET {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/

### Health check
GET {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/health

### Register a sensor (valid nested deployment path)
POST {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/sensors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "macAddress": "AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:01",
  "facility": "Facility A",
  "zone": "Zone 1",
  "subZone": "Sub-Zone B",
  "room": "Server Room 2",
  "nodeId": "Node-07",
  "category": 1
}

### Register a sensor with a missing tier (expect 400 from recursive validation)
POST {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/sensors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "macAddress": "AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:02",
  "facility": "Facility A",
  "zone": "Zone 1",
  "subZone": "",
  "room": "Server Room 2",
  "nodeId": "Node-08",
  "category": 0
}

### List sensors
GET {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/sensors

### Ingest a single reading (replace {{sensorId}} with an id from the list above)
POST {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/telemetry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sensorId": "{{sensorId}}",
  "value": 123.4
}

### Ingest a batch (jagged-array path)
POST {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/telemetry/batch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sensorId": "{{sensorId}}",
  "values": [121, 122, 124, 300]
}

### Get one sensor's telemetry snapshot
GET {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/telemetry/{{sensorId}}

### Get all telemetry snapshots
GET {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/telemetry

### Aggregate two meters (operator overload demo)
POST {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/telemetry/aggregate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "meterIdA": "{{sensorId}}",
  "meterIdB": "{{sensorId}}"
}

### Start simulated readings for a sensor
POST {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/sensors/{{sensorId}}/simulate/start

### Stop simulated readings
POST {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/sensors/{{sensorId}}/simulate/stop
